{"Title":"An Act relative to veteran disability benefits","BillNumber":"H3926","DocketNumber":"HD3492","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"D_R1","Name":"David Allen Robertson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T12:32:50.47"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"D_R1","Name":"David Allen Robertson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_R1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T12:32:50.47"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3926/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Robertson of Tewksbury, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3926) of David Allen Robertson relative to veteran disability benefits.  Veterans and Federal Affairs.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 6B of chapter 115 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in lines 19, 28 and 35, the figure “$2,000”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following figure:- $5,000.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 6B of said chapter 115, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by inserting after the third paragraph the following paragraph:-\r\n\tA veteran who suffers from post-traumatic stress disorder, symptoms of Persian Gulf illness, or injuries connected to tainted, poisoned or adulterated water at Camp Lejeune and such disorder, illness, or injuries have been certified by the Veterans’ Administration as service-connected and who is determined to be 80 per cent disabled by the Veterans’ Administration shall be paid the sum of $5,000 annually in 2 equal payments on August 1 and February 1. Such payments shall be due and payable from the date of the application.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}